direction: LR
dev[Desenvolvedor] -> gh[GitHub\nrepositório]
gh -> ci(GitHub Actions\nbuild · testes)
ci -> acr[/Registro de\ncontêineres/] : imagens Docker
acr -> web[Container App\nPim.Web]
acr -> api[Container App\nPim.Api]
web, api -> sql[(Azure SQL\nDatabase)]
cel[Celulares\n(app Flutter)] -> api
web, api --> mon[Application Insights\nlogs e alertas]
